tb/nvm_port/README.md
4: **In short.** The class F NVM port on its own, against independent device models: its
5: handshakes, its device-face deadline, its behaviour across resets, and the coverage of every
6: device-error arm. `make` builds and runs the suite at each of its deadline bounds, then the
7: randomized harness at each of the harness's bounds (the [Makefile](Makefile)'s `BUILDS`
8: counts them);
9: `make figures` re-measures every figure this page quotes and fails if the page has
10: drifted, and CI runs it.
11: 

